{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About This Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your stones, your AI, your own world.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>REVERSI xVSx</i> is a highly customizable Reversi battle game where you can use your own creations for stones, boards, backgrounds, BGM\u2014and even the CPU itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Try Almost Everything in the Demo!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-featured online battles between demo versions</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All custom assets (stones, board, background, BGM, CPU) can be used in the full version</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfa8 <strong>Fully Customizable!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Create or download your own stones, boards, backgrounds, music, and CPU opponents</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In-game guide explains how to make your own assets</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load from local files with ease</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd16 <strong>Build Your Own CPU Opponents!</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play against a custom CPU with an AI you've created.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can also set rewards for playing against it.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfb2 <strong>Variety of Game Modes</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Classic Reversi rules</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-color mode</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique rules like &quot;lose on misclick&quot;</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf10 <strong>Online Multiplayer &amp; Viewer Interaction</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Majority Vote Reversi&quot; for up to 10 players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Streamer mode: viewers vote in chat to decide moves</p></li></ul><p class=